---
import Layout from '@/layouts/Layout.astro'
import Button from '@/components/Button.astro'
---

<Layout
  title="Scrum Poker Case Study | Braeden Kilburn"
  description="Case study for Scrum Poker, a Vue and TypeScript planning poker app focused on fast team estimation sessions and clean facilitator workflows."
>
  <main class="case-study">
    <p class="eyebrow">Case Study</p>
    <h1>Scrum Poker</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      A planning poker app built with Vue, TypeScript, Bun, and DigitalOcean to
      help teams run fast, clear estimation sessions.
    </p>

    <div class="actions">
      <Button href="https://myscrumpoker.com" external>View Live</Button>
      <Button href="https://github.com/BraedenKilburn/ScrumPoker" external variant="secondary">
        View Code
      </Button>
    </div>

    <section>
      <h2>Problem</h2>
      <p>
        Planning meetings can slow down when estimation tools are clunky,
        unclear, or overloaded. The goal was to create a focused experience
        where facilitators can quickly start a session and participants can vote
        without friction.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>My Role</h2>
      <p>
        I designed and built the application experience, front-end architecture,
        interaction states, and deployment path.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Technical Decisions</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Used Vue and TypeScript for maintainable component-driven UI.</li>
        <li>Used Bun to keep the development/runtime workflow lightweight.</li>
        <li>Prioritized responsive layout and clear facilitator/participant flows.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Impact</h2>
      <p>
        This project demonstrates front-end architecture, full-stack product
        context, deployment ownership, and the ability to turn a common team
        workflow into a polished web app.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>What I Would Improve Next</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Add analytics around session completion and user flow drop-off.</li>
        <li>Improve onboarding for first-time facilitators.</li>
        <li>Add deeper accessibility testing for keyboard and screen-reader workflows.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .case-study {
    max-width: 850px;
    margin: 0 auto 4rem;
    padding: 2rem 1rem;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    color: var(--color-accent);
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 4rem);
    margin: 0.5rem 0 1rem;
  }

  .lede {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin: 1.5rem 0 2.5rem;
  }

  section {
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
  }

  section p,
  section li {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }
</style>
